{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cell door closed behind him for the last time, but freedom didn\u2019t feel like freedom. A cold device clung to his ankle, a reminder that every step was being watched. He had been released before his sentence was over, yet the law\u2019s eyes never left him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most men would have walked away, tried to rebuild their lives. But not him. His blood still carried the hunger for power. The streets were closed, so he turned to the one place that could not be locked down\u2014the internet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside the walls of his cramped room, he began again. A pc became his weapon, encrypted networks his battlefield. Day by day, the room transformed into the heart of a hidden empire. Money flowed, connections grew, and his name spread in silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But every empire built in the shadows lives under a sword. One mistake, one careless moment, and the FIB would strike. He knew the risk. He knew the end could come at any second.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still, he chose this path. For him, the empire was worth more than freedom.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038370/extras/ca8d1aa57b84cc3fd0edbac5118ee6cb.poster.avif?t=1761337017\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038370/extras/ca8d1aa57b84cc3fd0edbac5118ee6cb.webm?t=1761337017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038370/extras/ca8d1aa57b84cc3fd0edbac5118ee6cb.mp4?t=1761337017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You can easily craft and interact with everything with mouse clicks, there are 6 items you can craft in the current state of the game and can develop more in the future<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038370/extras/3d4a9ee1204974de01622b02d504010f.poster.avif?t=1761337017\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038370/extras/3d4a9ee1204974de01622b02d504010f.webm?t=1761337017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038370/extras/3d4a9ee1204974de01622b02d504010f.mp4?t=1761337017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>you can upgrade yourself throw pc and explore the application in pc</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038370/extras/4cd2cf19ceded00e4da46c47fd91b00c.poster.avif?t=1761337017\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038370/extras/4cd2cf19ceded00e4da46c47fd91b00c.webm?t=1761337017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038370/extras/4cd2cf19ceded00e4da46c47fd91b00c.mp4?t=1761337017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you can grow weed easily and interact with it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038370/extras/42fbe2b49b260a7fdfd862e2775eb4c2.poster.avif?t=1761337017\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038370/extras/42fbe2b49b260a7fdfd862e2775eb4c2.webm?t=1761337017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038370/extras/42fbe2